<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::kinetic_attack_intensity" target="global_bond_repricing::market_liquidity" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp increases in cross-border kinetic strikes trigger risk-off episodes that force primary dealers to pull back inventories and widen bid-ask spreads, degrading liquidity in regional and related global bond markets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_repricing</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::kinetic_attack_intensity" target="global_oil_reordering::oil_export_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased artillery, missile and air strikes against port terminals, storage and pipeline nodes in the Black Sea region and Ukraine physically damage export infrastructure and force port closures, lowering outbound oil and refined product volumes.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">global_oil_reordering</data>
</edge>
