  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Noticeable escalations in battlefield kinetic activity tied to use of foreign components or weapons (or to civilian infrastructure strikes) increase political pressure in the US to treat adversary supply chains as security risks, prompting more unilateral and multilateral tech restrictions that heighten US‑China tech tensions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
