  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising drone strikes against energy and logistics infrastructure create near-term supply disruptions and higher inflation readings, leading markets to price a higher and earlier central-bank policy rate path.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
