  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained high drone operational tempo in Ukraine accelerates production, proliferation and operational learning around long-range unmanned systems and maritime-delivery techniques that are exported or copied by regional actors (notably Iran and proxies), enabling more remote mine-laying and mine-delivery incidents in the Gulf corridor.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
