  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter financial sanctions restrict correspondent banking and payment rails and raise compliance costs, prompting non-resident investors and funds to repatriate or avoid exposures in affected bond markets and reducing net cross-border fixed-income flows.</data>
