  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained acceleration in defence procurement by governments and allied purchasers increases sovereign and government-guaranteed bond issuance to finance spending, adding supply and upward pressure on long-term government yields.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_repricing</data>
</edge>
