  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained increases in arms deliveries and munitions raise battlefield capabilities on one or both sides, prolonging operations and producing higher regional tension and confrontation levels that elevate geopolitical conflict intensity.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
