  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher institutionalized intelligence and policy coordination among Western allies enables harmonized designation lists, shared enforcement tools and coordinated legal instruments, strengthening the reach and coherence of sanctions regimes.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
