  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased intelligence and procurement‑monitoring cooperation among the US, EU and partners (spurred by the war) enables coordinated identification of dual‑use tech flows and rapid harmonization of restrictive policies, raising bilateral techno‑nationalist frictions with China.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
</edge>
