  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Improved institutionalized coordination, intelligence-sharing and tactics developed among NATO and partners in the Russia–Ukraine theatre are transferred to US and Gulf security partners, improving maritime domain awareness and convoy/escort procedures and thus raising commercial shipping confidence and transit volumes through the chokepoint.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
