<edge source="global_oil_reordering::legal_sanctions_regime_s" target="global_bond_repricing::market_liquidity" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Strengthening and broadening of legal/sanctions frameworks raises compliance costs and counterparty risk, causing dealers and international participants to withdraw or limit trading in affected bond markets and thereby reducing market depth and liquidity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_oil_reordering</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_repricing</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_oil_reordering::legal_sanctions_regime_s" target="russia_ukraine_war::sanctions_financial" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">A stronger, more coherent legal and enforcement framework (export controls, shipping rules, secondary sanctions) directly enables states and banks to impose and operationalize tougher financial restrictions on Russia's energy sector, raising aggregate financial pressure.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_oil_reordering</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_oil_reordering::legal_sanctions_regime_s" target="us_china_strategic_rival::geo_tech_tension" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Tightening or expansion of export controls and secondary-sanctions frameworks directly raises cross-border restrictions on AI-related goods and services, prompting reciprocal measures and elevating techno‑nationalist friction.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_oil_reordering</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_oil_reordering::legal_sanctions_regime_s" target="us_iran_gulf_escalation::kinetic_engagement" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Tightening sanctions that choke off oil revenue and insurance/access incentivizes targeted kinetic harassment and attacks by sanctioned actors seeking to raise the political and economic costs of shipping through the route.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_oil_reordering</data>
  <data key="d40">us_iran_gulf_escalation</data>
