  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">An increase in oil export flows raises exporters' foreign-currency receipts and associated outward capital recycling (sovereign wealth fund allocations, bank/intermediary investments), mechanically increasing net cross-border fixed‑income and related flows.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_oil_reordering</data>
