  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained or higher oil export volumes that preserve or increase export revenue provide the Russian state with fiscal resources that are then available to accelerate arms purchases and domestic procurement cycles.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_oil_reordering</data>
