  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained drop in oil export volumes and the resulting energy/market volatility incentivizes firms to centralize workloads with large, energy‑secure cloud providers that can guarantee power and resilience, increasing market concentration of AI infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_oil_reordering</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
