  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising oil export volumes boost fiscal receipts and sovereign/energy‑sector liquidity, which are then allocated into technology and infrastructure investments, increasing the stock of financial exposure tied to AI‑linked assets.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_oil_reordering</data>
