  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained rise in long-term sovereign yields increases debt-service burdens and refinancing costs for governments, forcing fiscal retrenchment (cuts to subsidies, investment or transfers) that erodes the governing party's capacity to implement major energy and foreign-policy decisions.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
