  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A deterioration in bond-market liquidity forces higher margins and wider financing spreads for commodity traders and national oil companies, causing trading houses to scale back hedging and pre-export financing and resulting in curtailed shipments and delayed exports.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_repricing</data>
  <data key="d40">global_oil_reordering</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_bond_repricing::market_liquidity" target="russia_ukraine_war::drone_attack_frequency" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A drying of bond and related market liquidity transmits into tighter FX and trade-finance conditions for dual-use components and maintenance chains, degrading availability and tempo of drone operations and reducing sortie frequency.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_repricing</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_bond_repricing::market_liquidity" target="us_china_strategic_rival::financial_exposure_ai" id="0">
