  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A sudden deterioration in bond-market liquidity raises funding stresses and volatility, prompting institutional investors and credit funds to de-risk by reducing positions in higher-volatility, AI-linked equities and private debt, lowering financial exposure to AI assets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
